#: postprocessing.md:1
msgid "Post-processing and analysis"
msgstr "後処理と解析"

#: postprocessing.md:2
msgid ""
"Here we assume that you checked the convergence of your system and that all "
"the run ended successfully (no protein unfolding, no other issues). Here we "
"will not focus on convergence, error calculation and metadynamics technical "
"details, considering that such topics are already covered by the "
"[Metadynamics tutorial](https://www.plumed-"
"tutorials.org/lessons/21/004/data/NAVIGATION.html)."
msgstr ""
"収束を確認し、Unfolding などの問題なく終了したと仮定します。収束、誤差計算、Metadynamics の技術的詳細は "
"[Metadynamics Tutorial](https://www.plumed-"
"tutorials.org/lessons/21/004/data/NAVIGATION.html) に譲ります。"

#: postprocessing.md:4
msgid "Reweighting"
msgstr "Reweighting"

#: postprocessing.md:5
msgid ""
"After the end of the simulation, we need to reweight our free energy "
"landscape on apt collective variables. As anticipated in the previous step, "
"we will use the distance from the origin of the reference frame $\\rho$ and "
"the number of contacts $c$. We thus prepare step-by-step a reweighting "
"script (you can find it in the GitHub folder, called `reweight.dat`)."
msgstr ""
"終了後、適切な Collective Variables に自由エネルギー地形を Reweighting します。前述の原点からの距離 $\\rho$ "
"と Contact 数 $c$ を使います。GitHub にある `reweight.dat` を順に作ります。"

#: postprocessing.md:7
msgid ""
"We begin from the reading of the relevant data files (refer to the "
"`plumed.dat` file if you do not remember what is contained in them):"
msgstr "まず必要なデータを読み込みます。内容は `plumed.dat` を参照してください。"

#: postprocessing.md:14
msgid ""
"After loading the data, we have to perform the reweighting of the "
"metadynamics potential via the [Tiwary-Parrinello "
"estimator](https://doi.org/10.1021/jp504920s). Concurrently, we remove the "
"(almost negligible) contribution of the RMSD restraining, obtaining the "
"final weights for the histogram"
msgstr ""
"[Tiwary-Parrinello Estimator](https://doi.org/10.1021/jp504920s) で "
"Metadynamics Potential を Reweighting し、同時に、ほぼ無視できる RMSD Restraint の寄与を除いて "
"Histogram の最終的な重みを得ます。"

#: postprocessing.md:24
msgid ""
"Having the weights, we can compute the histogram, considering the data from "
"200 ns to 1 µs to ignore the out-of-equilibrium portion of the simulation:"
msgstr "非平衡な初期部分を除くため、200 ns〜1 µs のデータで Weighted Histogram を求めます。"

#: postprocessing.md:46
msgid "This histogram can be converted to a free energy landscape"
msgstr "Histogram を自由エネルギー地形に変換します。"

#: postprocessing.md:70
msgid "and finally printed"
msgstr "最後に出力します。"

#: postprocessing.md:96
msgid ""
"From this data we can plot the 2D free energy landscape reweighted on "
"$\\rho$ and $c$:"
msgstr "このデータから、$\\rho$ と $c$ に Reweighting した2次元自由エネルギー地形を描けます。"

#: postprocessing.md:104
msgid "∆G calculation"
msgstr "∆G の計算"

#: postprocessing.md:105
msgid ""
"In the GitHub folder you can find a simple python script to get the free "
"energy difference between two basins, `deltaG.py`. You have to input the "
"path of the reweighted FES, the minima and the maxima in x and y for both "
"the basins and it returns the free energy difference. For my run, we defined"
" the two minima and obtained this result:"
msgstr ""
"GitHub の `deltaG.py` は、2 Basin の自由エネルギー差を求める簡単な Python スクリプトです。Reweighting "
"済み FES の Path と、各 Basin の x・y の最小・最大を渡すと差を返します。この実行では2つの極小を定義し、次の結果を得ました。"

#: postprocessing.md:110
msgid ""
"We now have $\\Delta G_{\\text{MetaD}}$, the last step is the calculation of"
" the entropic correction."
msgstr "$\\Delta G_{\\text{MetaD}}$ が求まったので、最後に Entropy 補正を計算します。"

#: postprocessing.md:112
msgid "Entropic correction calculation"
msgstr "Entropy 補正の計算"

#: postprocessing.md:113
msgid ""
"We have to compute the volume of the protein included in the sphere. To do "
"so, we can again use VMD. After loading the structure, we open the Tk "
"console and select all the atom that are within 2.8 nm from the center of "
"mass we computed in the previous step of the tutorial:"
msgstr ""
"球内のタンパク質体積を求めます。再び VMD で構造を読み込み、Tk Console で、前に求めた Center of Mass から2.8 nm "
"以内の全原子を選びます。"

#: postprocessing.md:117
msgid "having set up this selection, we can write an output PDB file."
msgstr "選択を PDB に出力します。"

#: postprocessing.md:121
msgid ""
"Having this file, we can use `gmx sasa` to have an estimate of the volume of"
" these atoms:"
msgstr "このファイルを `gmx sasa` に渡し、原子群の体積を推定します。"

#: postprocessing.md:125
msgid "obtaining a volume of 27.294 nm$^3$."
msgstr "27.294 nm$^3$ が得られます。"

#: postprocessing.md:127
msgid ""
"Putting this value and $\\rho_{\\text{s}}=2.8$ nm in the formula we get the "
"entropic correction"
msgstr "この値と $\\rho_{\\text{s}}=2.8$ nm を式に入れ、Entropy 補正を得ます。"

#: postprocessing.md:136
msgid ""
"And we have a final binding free energy value $\\Delta G^{0}=-(3.53+2.18)$ "
"kcal/mol $= -5.71$ kcal/mol, which is close to the experimental value of "
"$-5.2$ kcal/mol obtained by Morton _et al._ in [this "
"work](https://doi.org/10.1021/bi00027a006)."
msgstr ""
"最終的な結合自由エネルギーは $\\Delta G^{0}=-(3.53+2.18)$ kcal/mol $= -5.71$ kcal/mol "
"です。Morton らの [研究](https://doi.org/10.1021/bi00027a006) の実験値 $-5.2$ kcal/mol "
"に近い値です。"

#: postprocessing.md:138
msgid "[Back to VMetad home](NAVIGATION.md)"
msgstr "[VMetad のホームに戻る](NAVIGATION.md)"
